doctor can help me with.

00:01:04.740 --> 00:01:07.273
Maybe it was a death
wound from a past life.

00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:10.180
Maybe you're having a journey
with someone in this life

00:01:10.550 --> 00:01:12.810
