And now you have all that information,

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:36.213
wisdom, perspective and insight.

00:15:38.996 --> 00:15:39.970
You now

00:15:40.610 --> 00:15:42.830
can ask a question

00:15:43.940 --> 00:15:45.373
to your wise self,

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:47.660
the compilation

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:49.780
of all

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:53.663
of your lives, past, present and future.

00:15:54.069 --> 00:15:57.569
(calm instrumental music)

00:15:58.500 --> 00:16:00.833
But now ask this question,

00:16:01.877 --> 00:16:03.833
"Wise selves,

00:16:04.427 --> 00:16:08.260
"what can I take from this experience

00:16:08.797 --> 00:16:10.780
"to make my life

00:16:11.357 --> 00:16:14.460
"as a child of the 21st century

00:16:15.417 --> 00:16:17.073
"more joyous,

00:16:18.047 --> 00:16:20.063
"more intentional,

00:16:20.607 --> 00:16:22.430
"more authentic

00:16:23.077 --> 00:16:24.130
"and better

00:16:24.507 --> 00:16:26.680
"so that each and every day

00:16:27.317 --> 00:16:30.567
"I can be proud of myself?"

00:16:31.370 --> 00:16:34.013
And listen very carefully for that answer.

00:16:34.780 --> 00:16:38.633
It might sound like a wise voice,

00:16:39.820 --> 00:16:42.373
like the daughter of the divine.

00:16:44.780 --> 00:16:46.553
It might be a feeling,

00:16:47.640 --> 00:16:48.623
an insight,

00:16:51.060 --> 00:16:51.893
a vision,

00:16:53.170 --> 00:16:54.003
an idea

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:56.763
or just a knowing.

00:16:57.890 --> 00:17:01.043
When you get that answer to that question,

00:17:02.170 --> 00:17:03.273
memorize it.

00:17:04.800 --> 00:17:06.571
And now,
(snapping)

00:17:06.571 --> 00:17:08.823
breathe in that answer.

00:17:10.320 --> 00:17:12.590
Right into the pelvic floor

00:17:13.770 --> 00:17:16.793
and make it a part of your life.

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:20.183
And as you do that,

00:17:22.130 --> 00:17:23.683
you're so powerful,

00:17:25.580 --> 00:17:28.220
you could use the power of your mind

00:17:29.690 --> 00:17:30.830
to return

00:17:31.550 --> 00:17:32.830
to the tree of life

00:17:33.760 --> 00:17:35.120
and that dimension

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:36.760
beyond

00:17:37.660 --> 00:17:38.910
time and space

00:17:39.950 --> 00:17:42.810
and you can perch up
high on the tree of life

00:17:43.230 --> 00:17:44.903
for those who hold fast to it.

00:17:46.158 --> 00:17:48.690
And you can look down at the Earth

00:17:50.120 --> 00:17:51.440
and use the power

00:17:52.130 --> 00:17:54.510
of your mind

00:17:55.150 --> 00:17:57.350
to slow the Earth

00:17:58.030 --> 00:17:58.890
and let it stop

00:17:59.980 --> 00:18:03.053
and then begin to rotate it back again,

00:18:03.270 --> 00:18:05.060
going in the proper direction

00:18:05.800 --> 00:18:09.053
so that time is moving forward again.

00:18:10.150 --> 00:18:11.403
And when you do that,

00:18:12.990 --> 00:18:17.033
begin to allow yourself to descend,

00:18:17.520 --> 00:18:20.233
looking at our beautiful,
blue green marble.

00:18:20.960 --> 00:18:23.133
Our home, our Mother Earth.

00:18:24.690 --> 00:18:29.123
Coming down, seeing your
hemisphere where you live.

00:18:30.810 --> 00:18:31.923
Your continent.

00:18:33.080 --> 00:18:34.490
Coming down,

00:18:34.490 --> 00:18:35.323
seeing

00:18:35.850 --> 00:18:37.363
your county, your city,

00:18:38.730 --> 00:18:42.103
wherever you're doing
your past life regression.

00:18:43.300 --> 00:18:44.690
And come right through

00:18:45.480 --> 00:18:46.313
the roof

00:18:47.950 --> 00:18:51.520
and see your body there
with your eyes closed

00:18:52.540 --> 00:18:56.363
and with your next breath,
come into your physical body.

00:18:57.550 --> 00:19:00.703
And as I count from one up to five,

00:19:01.230 --> 00:19:05.920
you will awaken, refreshed,
alert, feeling so much better

00:19:06.210 --> 00:19:10.290
and you will remember who
you were in your past life

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:12.263
and everything you experienced.

00:19:12.990 --> 00:19:14.203
As you think about it,

00:19:15.350 --> 00:19:18.100
more and more and more details

00:19:18.750 --> 00:19:20.713
will come up into the conscious mind.

00:19:21.910 --> 00:19:23.980
You will remember

00:19:24.440 --> 00:19:26.080
that wonderful gift

00:19:26.460 --> 00:19:28.340
which was the answer to your question

00:19:28.850 --> 00:19:32.490
from your wise self about
how can I use this experience

00:19:32.570 --> 00:19:35.233
to make the here and now more powerful,

00:19:35.570 --> 00:19:36.863
more authentic,

00:19:37.180 --> 00:19:38.893
more joyous,

00:19:39.260 --> 00:19:42.640
so that I can be proud of who I am

00:19:43.330 --> 00:19:46.290
and always make wise decisions

00:19:46.570 --> 00:19:47.403
for me

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:52.700
so that I can honor my highest intention

00:19:52.900 --> 00:19:56.280
for myself, my family and everyone

00:19:56.930 --> 00:19:58.580
who I have the privilege to meet?

00:19:59.700 --> 00:20:01.573
One, two, slowly, calmly,

00:20:02.350 --> 00:20:03.993
three is that nice deep breath,

00:20:04.060 --> 00:20:05.610
feeling the breath in the body,

00:20:06.130 --> 00:20:07.940
four is a very alert number

00:20:08.760 --> 00:20:11.283
and five is eyes open,

00:20:11.440 --> 00:20:12.843
wide awake.

00:20:13.930 --> 00:20:16.550
Now when you're ready, pick up your book

00:20:17.920 --> 00:20:20.893
and write down the
answers to the questions.

00:20:21.590 --> 00:20:24.950
Write down in what way this experience

00:20:25.050 --> 00:20:28.193
revealed the answers to your intention.

00:20:28.690 --> 00:20:30.500
And in what way you're gonna make

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:32.503
positive choices in your life.

00:20:32.930 --> 00:20:34.030
Because you know what?

00:20:34.980 --> 00:20:37.430
You're too good to hang
out in your comfort zone.

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:40.090
And you want more out of life

00:20:40.770 --> 00:20:42.620
and you're not gonna settle for less.

00:20:43.600 --> 00:20:46.480
Because you know now
there's only one direction

00:20:47.490 --> 00:20:49.123
and that direction is forward.

00:20:50.290 --> 00:20:52.623
I hope you enjoyed your
past life regression.

00:20:53.520 --> 00:20:55.083
Enjoy the rest of your day.

00:20:55.710 --> 00:20:59.210
(calm instrumental music)

00:21:05.990 --> 00:21:08.320
- Hey, Unsolved is on a new
channel, and now your part.

00:21:08.320 --> 00:21:09.153
- [Both] Subscribe here.

00:21:09.153 --> 00:21:10.073
- That was my part.

